{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54693","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，牛鬬竞争时。\n更有傍边持戟立，戟人无首影依稀，宗庙必倾危。\n（首本此首两收，前二句一作「太阳鬬，竞与日争时」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}